{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27354","headline":"祖龙行 · 常楚老","name":"祖龙行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"黑云兵气射天裂，壮士朝眠梦冤结。\n祖龙一夜死沙丘，胡亥空随鲍鱼辙。\n腐肉偷生三千里，僞书先赐扶苏死。\n墓接骊山土未乾，瑞光已向芒砀起。\n陈胜城中鼓三下，秦家天地如崩瓦。\n龙蛇撩乱入咸阳，少帝空随汉家马。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"常楚老","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27354.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27354","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}